<p>		 Second Quarter   Incr/    Year-to-Date     Incr/</p>
<p>			  1997   1996 (Decr)   1997    1996  (Decr)</p>
<p> Net Sales	  $218.2 $214.0     2% $418.2  $415.1	1%</p>
